Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:44:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Control board: drive the on-screen deck's slides (host
 override)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- the deck that's ON SCREEN gets ‹ / jump-to-slide / › on its queue card
  (inside the presenter phone controller card when a code is issued,
  as its own strip otherwise), with a live 'Slide n / N' readout
- the board opens its own deck connection with pin 'screen:<token>':
  good only while that screen is active and showing that deck
- a host override: works with or without the slide remote's lock, so a
  dead phone or remote never strands a talk; phones follow the board
  and the board follows the phones
- share_dict carries the on-air deck's code; tests incl. WebSocket
